        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In the afternoon, I work on a project that requires both creativity and precision, I am designing a very specific object. I then present my progress to the team, sharing the details of my work without leaving anything out."
